@startuml 비밀번호 BCrypt 해시 적용 전후 비교 (시퀀스 다이어그램)

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title 비밀번호 BCrypt 해시 적용 전후 비교

== 회원가입 시퀀스: BCrypt 적용 전 (현재 상태) ==

participant "클라이언트" as Client
participant "MemberController" as Controller
participant "MemberService" as Service
participant "Member\n(도메인 모델)" as Domain
participant "MemberRepository" as Repository
participant "Database\n(members 테이블)" as DB

activate Client

Client -> Controller: POST /api/members/signup\n{email, password: "plain123", nickname, role}
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: signup(request)
activate Service

Service -> Domain: createForSignup(\n  email, password: "plain123", ...\n)
activate Domain
note right
  현재: 비밀번호를 그대로 전달
  password = request.password
  (평문 저장)
end note
Domain --> Service: Member(password: "plain123")
deactivate Domain

Service -> Repository: save(member)
activate Repository

Repository -> DB: INSERT INTO members\n(email, password: "plain123", ...)
activate DB
note right
  ⚠️ 위험: 비밀번호가 평문으로 저장됨
  DB 유출 시 비밀번호 그대로 노출
end note
DB --> Repository: INSERT 성공
deactivate DB

Repository --> Service: Member(password: "plain123")
deactivate Repository

Service --> Controller: Member 응답
deactivate Service

Controller --> Client: 201 Created\n{memberId, email, ...}
deactivate Controller

deactivate Client

== 회원가입 시퀀스: BCrypt 적용 후 (개선안) ==

participant "클라이언트" as Client2
participant "MemberController" as Controller2
participant "MemberService" as Service2
participant "BCryptPasswordEncoder" as Encoder
participant "Member\n(도메인 모델)" as Domain2
participant "MemberRepository" as Repository2
participant "Database\n(members 테이블)" as DB2

activate Client2

Client2 -> Controller2: POST /api/members/signup\n{email, password: "plain123", nickname, role}
activate Controller2

Controller2 -> Service2: signup(request)
activate Service2

Service2 -> Encoder: encode(request.password)
activate Encoder
note right
  BCrypt로 비밀번호 해시화
  "plain123" -> "$2a$10$..."
  (60자 해시 문자열)
end note
Encoder --> Service2: hashedPassword: "$2a$10$..."
deactivate Encoder

Service2 -> Domain2: createForSignup(\n  email, password: "$2a$10$...", ...\n)
activate Domain2
note right
  해시화된 비밀번호를 전달
  password = hashedPassword
end note
Domain2 --> Service2: Member(password: "$2a$10$...")
deactivate Domain2

Service2 -> Repository2: save(member)
activate Repository2

Repository2 -> DB2: INSERT INTO members\n(email, password: "$2a$10$...", ...)
activate DB2
note right
  ✅ 안전: 해시화된 비밀번호만 저장
  DB 유출 시에도 원본 비밀번호 복구 불가능
end note
DB2 --> Repository2: INSERT 성공
deactivate DB2

Repository2 --> Service2: Member(password: "$2a$10$...")
deactivate Repository2

Service2 --> Controller2: Member 응답
deactivate Service2

Controller2 --> Client2: 201 Created\n{memberId, email, ...}
deactivate Controller2

deactivate Client2

== 로그인 시퀀스: BCrypt 적용 전 (현재 상태) ==

participant "클라이언트" as Client3
participant "MemberController" as Controller3
participant "MemberService" as Service3
participant "MemberRepository" as Repository3
participant "Database\n(members 테이블)" as DB3
participant "Member\n(도메인 모델)" as Domain3

activate Client3

Client3 -> Controller3: POST /api/members/login\n{email, password: "plain123"}
activate Controller3

Controller3 -> Service3: login(request)
activate Service3

Service3 -> Repository3: findByEmail(email)
activate Repository3

Repository3 -> DB3: SELECT * FROM members\nWHERE email = ?
activate DB3
DB3 --> Repository3: Member(password: "plain123")
deactivate DB3

Repository3 --> Service3: Member(password: "plain123")
deactivate Repository3

Service3 -> Domain3: verifyPassword("plain123")
activate Domain3
note right
  현재: 평문 비교
  if (this.password != rawPassword)
  "plain123" == "plain123" ✓
end note
Domain3 --> Service3: 검증 성공
deactivate Domain3

Service3 -> Service3: JWT 토큰 생성
Service3 --> Controller3: LoginResult
deactivate Service3

Controller3 --> Client3: 200 OK\n{accessToken, refreshToken, ...}
deactivate Controller3

deactivate Client3

== 로그인 시퀀스: BCrypt 적용 후 (개선안) ==

participant "클라이언트" as Client4
participant "MemberController" as Controller4
participant "MemberService" as Service4
participant "MemberRepository" as Repository4
participant "Database\n(members 테이블)" as DB4
participant "Member\n(도메인 모델)" as Domain4
participant "BCryptPasswordEncoder" as Encoder2

activate Client4

Client4 -> Controller4: POST /api/members/login\n{email, password: "plain123"}
activate Controller4

Controller4 -> Service4: login(request)
activate Service4

Service4 -> Repository4: findByEmail(email)
activate Repository4

Repository4 -> DB4: SELECT * FROM members\nWHERE email = ?
activate DB4
DB4 --> Repository4: Member(password: "$2a$10$...")
deactivate DB4

Repository4 --> Service4: Member(password: "$2a$10$...")
deactivate Repository4

Service4 -> Domain4: verifyPassword("plain123")
activate Domain4

Domain4 -> Encoder2: matches(rawPassword, hashedPassword)
activate Encoder2
note right
  BCrypt로 비교
  matches("plain123", "$2a$10$...")
  - 해시에서 salt 추출
  - rawPassword를 같은 salt로 해시화
  - 두 해시 비교
end note
Encoder2 --> Domain4: true (일치)
deactivate Encoder2

Domain4 --> Service4: 검증 성공
deactivate Domain4

Service4 -> Service4: JWT 토큰 생성
Service4 --> Controller4: LoginResult
deactivate Service4

Controller4 --> Client4: 200 OK\n{accessToken, refreshToken, ...}
deactivate Controller4

deactivate Client4

== 주요 변경 사항 요약 ==

note over Client, DB4
  **BCrypt 적용 전:**
  - 비밀번호가 평문으로 DB에 저장됨
  - verifyPassword에서 평문 비교
  - DB 유출 시 비밀번호 즉시 노출
  
  **BCrypt 적용 후:**
  - 비밀번호가 해시로 DB에 저장됨
  - verifyPassword에서 BCrypt.matches() 사용
  - DB 유출 시에도 원본 비밀번호 복구 불가능
  - 각 비밀번호마다 고유한 salt 사용
end note

@enduml
